<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow"><title>Task Board — An Elang Learning Project</title><link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/task-board.css"></head><body><div class="board-shell"><header><a class="board-brand" href="https://elangphp.com/learn/build-a-task-board">e<span>.</span> <strong>elang</strong> <small>LEARNING PROJECT</small></a><a href="https://elangphp.com/learn/build-a-task-board">Read the walkthrough ↗</a></header><main><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE STRUCTURE FOR YOUR NEXT IDEA</p><h1>Your small<br><em>task board.</em></h1><p class="intro">Add something to do. Mark a small win. See the pieces of an Elang application working together.</p><div class="board-summary"><span>{{ tasks|length }} task{{ tasks|length == 1 ? '' : 's' }}</span><span>{{ completed }} complete</span><span>20 task limit</span></div><form action="{{ base_path }}/add" method="post" class="add-form"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ token }}"><label for="task-title">What would you like to do?</label><div><input type="text" id="task-title" name="title" value="{{ input }}" maxlength="100" placeholder="Build my first Elang application" required{% if errors %} aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="task-errors"{% endif %}><button type="submit">Add task →</button></div>{% if errors %}<ul id="task-errors" class="form-errors" role="alert">{% for error in errors %}<li>{{ error }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}</form><div class="task-list" aria-label="Your tasks">{% for task in tasks %}<article class="task{% if task.done %} is-done{% endif %}"><form action="{{ base_path }}/toggle/{{ task.id }}" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ token }}"><button class="task-toggle" aria-label="Mark {{ task.title }} {{ task.done ? 'incomplete' : 'complete' }}">{{ task.done ? '✓' : '○' }}</button></form><span class="task-title">{{ task.title }}</span><form action="{{ base_path }}/delete/{{ task.id }}" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ token }}"><button class="task-remove" aria-label="Remove {{ task.title }}">Remove</button></form></article>{% else %}<div class="board-empty"><span>↗</span><h2>Start with one small thing.</h2><p>Your first task will appear here.</p></div>{% endfor %}</div><aside class="board-explanation"><strong>What you’re learning</strong><p>Routes → middleware → controller → validation → session → HTML response.</p><p>This example keeps tasks in your current browser session. It has no accounts or shared database; tasks can disappear when the session expires.</p></aside>{% if is_site_demo %}<a class="back-link" href="/learn/build-a-task-board">← Back to the complete project lesson</a>{% endif %}</main><footer>HTML on the frontend. Elang on the backend. <a href="https://elangphp.com">Built with clarity ↗</a></footer></div></body></html>
